{"unit_id":"tag:04C5:statement","translation":"引理<REF_0001>缺少<MATH_0001>的情形。原因是，给定环（ring）<MATH_0002>、理想（ideal）<MATH_0003>以及忠实平坦（faithfully flat）、有限表示（finitely presented）的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0004>，没有理由认为能找到<TEXTITOPEN_0001>任何<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>平坦（flat）有限表示（finitely presented）的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0005>，满足<MATH_0006>，使得<MATH_0007>经由<MATH_0008>分解（factors through）。因此引理<REF_0002>的证明不适用于fppf拓扑（topology）。事实上，断言<MATH_0009>正合（exact），条件为<MATH_0010>是闭浸入（closed immersion），很可能是假的。若你知道一个例子，请发邮件至<TEXTOPEN_0001>stacks.project@gmail.com<TEXTCLOSE_0001>。\n","allowed_english":["fppf","stacks.project","gmail.com"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"factors through","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"factors through","target_term":"分解","context":"环映射的分解。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
